# yt-dlp-gui Environment Variables (Example)
#
# This is a template file. Copy it to .env for local development.
# NEVER commit .env or any file containing actual secrets to git!

# Example: Override yt-dlp binary path for testing
# YTDLP_BIN=/path/to/custom/yt-dlp

# Example: Custom data directory for testing
# YT_DLP_GUI_DATA_DIR=/tmp/yt-dlp-gui-test

# Note: In production, the app uses ~/.yt-dlp-gui/ automatically.
# These env vars are only for development/testing purposes.
